  "scope": "0.10.1-claudegpt.18: Rust PTY host (rust/reframe-host, ConPTY in rust/reframe-conpty, the only crate with unsafe) speaking the Node host's pipe protocol (docs/ptyhost-protocol.md); opt-in with REFRAME_PTYHOST=rust (default stays Node; falls back to Node if the Rust files are missing); hosts of the other kind keep their sessions, new sessions go to the configured host; versioned <version>-rust-<hash12> runtime copy; shared conformance suite (npm run test:conformance) run against both hosts in CI; CI rust job (fmt, clippy -D warnings, tests, release build artifact) feeding packaging (resources/reframe-host with conpty.dll and OpenConsole.exe); inspect-payload and build-windows require the CI-built host; stop-managed counts reframe-host.exe as a PTY host",
